# Credential names are declared here with empty values; real values stay in a
# local .env or approved secret manager and never enter Git.
#
# Fields are required by default. Put `# optional` immediately before a field,
# or after its empty assignment, when a workflow can run without it.
#
# API_TOKEN=
# optional
# REPORT_URL=
#
# No integration credentials are required by the baseline cockpit yet.
